{
  "page": {
    "name": "团队编辑",
    "parent": "bot/team/team/list",
    "type": 2,
    "auth": [
      {
        "key": "bot/team/team/create",
        "name": "团队新增",
        "query": {
          "id": "empty"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "bot/team/team/update",
        "name": "团队编辑",
        "query": {
          "id": "required"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "layout": {
    "type": "container",
    "children": {
      "page-main": {
        "type": "main",
        "className": "p-0",
        "children": {
          "dialog-shell": {
            "type": "container",
            "className": "w-full"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "nodes": {
    "dialog-shell": [
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "name": "团队分类",
        "value": "form.cate_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "model": "bot.team.NewTeamCateModel",
          "order": "sort asc,id asc"
        },
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "required",
            "message": "团队分类不能为空。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[260px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-input",
        "placeholder": "例如：内容运营团队",
        "value": "form.name",
        "mode": "form",
        "validate": [
          {
            "type": "required",
            "message": "团队名称不能为空。"
          }
        ],
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-select",
        "name": "素材方案",
        "placeholder": "不使用官方素材",
        "value": "form.material_pack_id",
        "mode": "form",
        "option": {
          "model": "bot.team.NewMaterialPackModel",
          "filters": {
            "status": 1
          },
          "order": "sort asc,id asc"
        },
        "info": "选择后，该团队可以使用素材方案中的官方提示词、图片、音频和视频；留空则不展示官方素材。",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "controlClassName": "max-w-[320px]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-array",
        "name": "资产分类",
        "value": "form.asset_cates",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "资产分类是项目作品的目录，可配置产物类型和单个、多个、有序多个规则。项目流程中的保存节点可以选择分类，作品会沉淀到对应目录下。",
        "meta": {
          "pageRoute": "/bot/team/asset_cate/update",
          "addText": "添加资产分类",
          "drag": "sort",
          "formLayout": "horizontal"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-array",
        "name": "团队能力",
        "value": "form.team_powers",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "配置团队拥有的专业能力，例如文本生成、图像生成、视频生成等，供工具入口、工作流和团队角色调用。工具运行结果由用户按需保存。",
        "meta": {
          "pageRoute": "/bot/team/team_power/update",
          "addText": "添加能力",
          "drag": "sort",
          "formLayout": "horizontal"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-switch",
        "name": "启用创作",
        "value": "form.project_enabled",
        "mode": "form",
        "info": "开启后，用户可在该团队工作区创建项目并进入画布编辑。关闭只隐藏项目入口，不影响团队能力、角色和流程配置。",
        "meta": {
          "trueValue": 1,
          "falseValue": 2,
          "formLayout": "horizontal"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "form-textarea",
        "placeholder": "写这个团队的完整提示词：职责、目标、口吻、边界和工作方式都放在这里。",
        "value": "form.description",
        "mode": "form",
        "meta": {
          "formLayout": "horizontal",
          "rows": 8
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "form": {
      "_fields": [
        "cate_id",
        "name",
        "material_pack_id",
        "asset_cates",
        "team_powers",
        "project_enabled",
        "description"
      ],
      "id": 0,
      "cate_id": 1,
      "name": "",
      "material_pack_id": "",
      "asset_cates": [],
      "team_powers": [],
      "project_enabled": 1,
      "description": ""
    }
  },
  "state": {},
  "action": {
    "submit": {
      "type": "save",
      "params": "form",
      "before": {
        "service": "bot.team.TeamHook.BeforeSaveTeam"
      }
    }
  }
}
